2.0.0 2026-10-26
  - Brings in the OpenNeuro ds004362 1.0.1 release (2026-10-13), metadata only; no recording file changes.
    A new upstream release takes a major version on NEMAR.
  - participants.tsv: sub-044 values realigned to their columns (Gender M; Age and Handedness n/a). Before,
    Gender held n/a and Age held M.
  - task-motion_events.json: Units "second" -> "s"; descriptions removed for trial_type, response_time and
    stim_file, which appear in none of the 1526 events.tsv files (all use onset, duration, sample, value);
    Description added. Levels BASE1T1 and BASE2T1 added for the two sub-089 baseline markers that the PhysioNet
    source annotates (S089R01/R02: T0 for 0.1 s, then T1 to the end of the run); without them the validator
    rejects those two values.
  - participants.json: Description added. New task-motion_eeg.json (task description, instructions, institution).
  - 1526 channels.tsv: type and units n/a -> EEG and uV.
  - 3052 per-run coordsystem.json and electrodes.tsv files replaced by one subject-level pair per subject
    (the 14 per-run copies were byte-identical).
  - dataset_description.json: Version 1.0.0 -> 2.0.0; GeneratedBy added; SourceDatasets now OpenNeuro
    ds004362 1.0.1 and PhysioNet eegmmidb 1.0.0 (10.13026/C28G6P).

1.0.0 2022-12-15
  - Initial release on OpenNeuro
